  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. Fixture: private/protected/public/default class constants all serialize visibility=public with modifiers [], while a private property serializes private. php.py:1292-1310 passes [], True and visibility_from_modifiers([]). The symptom is wider than is_exported: serialized visibility and the stable_id visibility component are also wrong. MECHANISM: php const_declaration branch never reads visibility_modifier (passes [] and True)."  # ed86
